{"id":"quantite_","lemma":"quantité","pos":"noun","rank":2733,"glosses":["quantity"],"ipa":"/kɑ̃.ti.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2f/Fr-quantit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-quantit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"quantités"},"formAudio":{"quantités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-quantit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Quelle quantité de neige est tombée ?","en":"How much snow fell?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097836","words":[{"g":"which?"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"fall"}]},{"text":"Les bonnes choses viennent en petites quantités.","en":"Good things come in small packages.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"small, little","l":"petit"},null]},{"text":"Il a une grande quantité de livres.","en":"He has a large number of books.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"book","l":"livre"}]},{"text":"De quelle quantité de papier avez-vous besoin ?","en":"What quantity of paper do you need?","words":[{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"which?"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"paper"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"need"}]},{"text":"La qualité importe plus que la quantité.","en":"Quality is more important than quantity.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"quality"},{"g":"to matter","l":"importer"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}